            "content": "Introduction",
            "scrollToId": 0
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "size": "H3",
            "content": "For very complex systems the state diagram might not be well suited. In this case a tool called the Mnemonic Documented State Diagram or MDS Diagram can incorporate in a more compact way all the complexities of a large system controller."
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "size": "H3",
            "content": "More information about MDS diagrams can be found in the book An Engineering Approach to Digital Design by William I. Fletcher."
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "size": "H1",
            "content": "Large scale digital system design",
            "scrollToId": 1
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "size": "H3",
            "content": "For complex digital logic system with a large number of inputs, the following design methodology, from the point of view of a system controller, can be used:"
        },
        {
            "type": "widget",
            "sub_type": "numbered_list",
            "items": [
                {
                    "content": "State main definitions and specifications of the problem/system"
                },
                {
                    "content": "Define basic operations, limits and restrictions.",
                    "children": [
                        "Draw a basic (simplified) block diagram",
                        "Draw a simplified (general) flowchart diagram"
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "content": "Define the system timing requirement",
                    "children": [
                        "Draw a general time diagram"
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "content": "Detail the controller's sequential behaviour",
                    "children": [
                        "Draw detailed time diagram",
                        "Draw detailed flowchart diagram",
                        "Draw detailed block diagram"
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "content": "Draw MDS diagram"
                },
                {
                    "content": "Choose the controller architecture: SSI (logic gates and flip-flops), MSI (based on MUXs, …) or LSI (ROM based, …)"
                },
                {
                    "content": "Assign state codes"
                },
                {
                    "content": "Implement the circuit based on the design"
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
